                "title": "Modern Stepped Rose Deadbolt, Fusion B1",
                "description": "Modern Stepped Rose Deadbolt Fusion B1 - This deadbolt features the graduated styling that is associated with the Art-Deco design aesthetic, making this modish deadbolt a must have for heavy duty security with a contemporary twist. After all, there is no reason that something functional can't be fashionable as well. Available as either a single cylinder or as a double cylinder, Fusion Hardware's Stepped Rose Deadbolt meets ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Plus it is available in 4 beautiful finishes.",
